## Products

### Search

Search the web and get full page content for each result in one call, with date, domain, country, and PDF filters. Specialized indexes cover developer docs and code, and US law.

- [Search API (Markdown)](https://www.firecrawl.dev/search.md)
- [Search API (HTML)](https://www.firecrawl.dev/search)
- [Search documentation (Markdown)](https://docs.firecrawl.dev/features/search.md)
- [Search documentation (HTML)](https://docs.firecrawl.dev/features/search)

### Scrape

Turn any URL, including JavaScript-rendered pages, into clean Markdown, HTML, screenshots, or structured JSON.

- [Scrape API (Markdown)](https://www.firecrawl.dev/scrape.md)
- [Scrape API (HTML)](https://www.firecrawl.dev/scrape)
- [Scrape documentation (Markdown)](https://docs.firecrawl.dev/features/scrape.md)
- [Scrape documentation (HTML)](https://docs.firecrawl.dev/features/scrape)

### Crawl and Map

Crawl discovers and scrapes every subpage on a site into Markdown or JSON, with path filters and depth limits. Map lists a site's URLs without scraping them.

- [Crawl API (Markdown)](https://www.firecrawl.dev/crawl.md)
- [Crawl API (HTML)](https://www.firecrawl.dev/crawl)
- [Crawl documentation (Markdown)](https://docs.firecrawl.dev/features/crawl.md)
- [Crawl documentation (HTML)](https://docs.firecrawl.dev/features/crawl)
- [Map documentation (Markdown)](https://docs.firecrawl.dev/features/map.md)
- [Map documentation (HTML)](https://docs.firecrawl.dev/features/map)

### Parse

Convert PDFs, DOCX, and other document types to Markdown or JSON, with OCR for scanned pages.

- [Document Parsing API (Markdown)](https://www.firecrawl.dev/parse.md)
- [Document Parsing API (HTML)](https://www.firecrawl.dev/parse)
- [Parse documentation (Markdown)](https://docs.firecrawl.dev/features/parse.md)
- [Parse documentation (HTML)](https://docs.firecrawl.dev/features/parse)

### Interact

Drive a managed browser to click, type, fill forms, paginate, and scroll through dynamic pages and multi-step flows, started on its own or from a scrape.

- [Interact API (Markdown)](https://www.firecrawl.dev/interact.md)
- [Interact API (HTML)](https://www.firecrawl.dev/interact)
- [Interact documentation (Markdown)](https://docs.firecrawl.dev/features/interact.md)
- [Interact documentation (HTML)](https://docs.firecrawl.dev/features/interact)

### Agent

Describe the data you need, with an optional JSON schema, and Agent searches, navigates, and returns it. URLs are optional.

- [Agent](https://www.firecrawl.dev/agent)
- [Agent documentation (Markdown)](https://docs.firecrawl.dev/features/agent.md)
- [Agent documentation (HTML)](https://docs.firecrawl.dev/features/agent)

### Monitor

Watch named pages, a scheduled crawl of a site, or a web search, and get a webhook, email, or Slack notification when something changes or appears.

- [Monitor (Markdown)](https://www.firecrawl.dev/monitor.md)
- [Monitor (HTML)](https://www.firecrawl.dev/monitor)
- [Monitor documentation (Markdown)](https://docs.firecrawl.dev/features/monitoring.md)
