- [Monitor API reference (Markdown)](https://docs.firecrawl.dev/api-reference/endpoint/monitor-create.md)
- [Monitor API reference (HTML)](https://docs.firecrawl.dev/api-reference/endpoint/monitor-create)

### Alexandria

Get typed records from data providers and specialized indexes (company and people data, SEC filings, real estate, sports, legal and research papers) without scraping, through the same Firecrawl API, MCP server, or CLI. Finding tools is free; each call is billed.

- [Alexandria library index](https://alexandria.firecrawl.dev)
