## Pricing

Free (1,000 credits a month, no card), Hobby ($19/month billed monthly, or $16/month billed annually, 5,000 credits), Standard ($99/month billed monthly, or $83/month billed annually, 100,000 credits), Growth ($399/month billed monthly, or $333/month billed annually, 500,000 credits), Scale ($749/month billed monthly, or $599/month billed annually, 1,000,000 credits), and Enterprise (custom). Prices are in USD.

Credits are shared across all endpoints. 1 credit = 1 page on a basic scrape or crawl, and 1 credit per Map call. Search costs 2 credits per 10 results; Interact costs 2 credits per browser minute; Monitor costs 1 credit per page per check. Structured formats (JSON, Question, Highlight) add 4 credits per page; Monitor's Deterministic JSON engine instead bills a flat 7 credits per page per check. PDF parsing costs 1 credit per PDF page. Agent is in preview with 5 free runs a day, then priced in credits by usage. A scrape that returns no result is not charged.

Pay-as-you-go is available on paid plans: when your credits run out, it adds credits at your plan's rate in 5 USD increments, up to a monthly limit you set in billing settings. On a paid plan you can also buy extra credits by hand at any time, without changing plans.

- [Pricing (Markdown)](https://www.firecrawl.dev/pricing.md)
- [Pricing (HTML)](https://www.firecrawl.dev/pricing)
- [Enterprise (Markdown)](https://www.firecrawl.dev/enterprise.md)
- [Enterprise (HTML)](https://www.firecrawl.dev/enterprise)

