## Changelog

- [Changelog](https://www.firecrawl.dev/changelog): Latest product updates, new endpoint launches, and engine upgrades. Every entry has its own markdown page; the full list is at https://www.firecrawl.dev/changelog.md.
- [Introducing Firecrawl MCP v3](https://www.firecrawl.dev/changelog/firecrawl-mcp-v3.md): Give your agents 3000+ tools with automatic provider waterfalls, 60x higher rate limits, 4x more usage, and parallel subtasks. Available for every harness. (November 12, 2026)
- [AI/ML Research Index in ChatGPT & Claude](https://www.firecrawl.dev/changelog/ai-ml-research-index.md): Ask ChatGPT, Claude, or any agent harness with Firecrawl to find the right AI/ML paper, even one posted today, and read its full text. (November 11, 2026)
- [Introducing job search tools for ChatGPT & Claude](https://www.firecrawl.dev/changelog/job-tools.md): Match your resume to 7M+ open roles, find execs to email from 250M+ people and see what they care about before you reach out. (November 10, 2026)
- [200K GitHub stars, and 2,000 plushies to say thanks](https://www.firecrawl.dev/changelog/200k-github-stars.md): We hit 200K GitHub stars, so we made 2,000 plushies to say thanks, and you can claim yours with the Firecrawl plugin while supplies last. (November 9, 2026)
- [Introducing SEC filings for ChatGPT and Claude](https://www.firecrawl.dev/changelog/sec-filings.md): Give your AI agents SEC filings from 8,000+ public companies: 10-Ks, 8-Ks, insider trades and 13F holdings in Alexandria. (November 6, 2026)
- [Introducing free life sciences research for ChatGPT and Claude](https://www.firecrawl.dev/changelog/life-sciences-research.md): Ask ChatGPT or Claude about a drug, disease or gene and get answers drawn from 41M+ life sciences research papers in one step. (November 5, 2026)
- [Legal Retrieval Benchmark: three search APIs on 581 official-document requests](https://www.firecrawl.dev/changelog/legal-retrieval-benchmark.md): Three search APIs on 581 legal research requests, scored against the official document. The Government & Legal Index leads on gold@1 and gold@10. (November 4, 2026)
- [Introducing free Election Records in Alexandria](https://www.firecrawl.dev/changelog/election-records-launch.md): Ask your AI agents about all 470 House and Senate races: results as each state reports, who funds each campaign and how incumbents voted. (November 3, 2026)
Follow product launches, new endpoints, new Alexandria providers, and engine upgrades. Every entry has its own Markdown page, and the full list is at https://www.firecrawl.dev/changelog.md.

- [Changelog index (Markdown)](https://www.firecrawl.dev/changelog.md)
- [Changelog index (HTML)](https://www.firecrawl.dev/changelog)

